.TH start-cli-server-set-nut 1  "set-nut "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-set\-nut \- Configure UPS monitoring with Network UPS Tools
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server set\-nut\fR [\fB\-\-disabled\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configure UPS monitoring with Network UPS Tools
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-disabled\fR
Store the settings without starting monitoring
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-set\-nut\-server(1)
Monitor a UPS connected directly to this server
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-set\-nut\-client(1)
Monitor a UPS served by another NUT server
